# Signup and Auth Flow Fixes (Strict Enforcement)

The goal is to completely eliminate automatic login and dashboard redirection after a user signs up. We will enforce a strict "verify-before-login" policy at both the UI and Auth Provider levels.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The `AuthContext` will now actively block unverified users from being considered "authenticated". This means unverified users will NOT have a session or user object in the context, even if Supabase technically returns one after signup.

## Proposed Changes

### Auth and Session Management

#### [MODIFY] [AuthContext.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/ReceiptVault/src/components/AuthContext.tsx)
- Import `useRouter` from `next/navigation`.
- Update `onAuthStateChange`:
    - IF `session.user` exists AND `email_confirmed_at` is NULL:
        - `setUser(null)`
        - `setSession(null)`
        - STOP execution (do not redirect, do not store session).
    - ONLY IF `email_confirmed_at` exists:
        - `setUser(user)`
        - `setSession(session)`
        - `router.push('/dashboard')`

### Login & Registration UI

#### [MODIFY] [login/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/ReceiptVault/src/app/login/page.tsx)
- **RegisterModal component**:
    - Add `const [signupSuccess, setSignupSuccess] = useState(false)`.
    - Update `handleSubmit`:
        - After successful `supabase.auth.signUp`, ONLY call `setSignupSuccess(true)`.
        - REMOVE `setUser`, `onClose`, and `router.push`.
    - Update render logic:
        - IF `signupSuccess` is true, RENDER ONLY the success state:
            - Title: "Account Created Successfully!"
            - Animation: Lottie success (or nice CSS placeholder if player not ready).
            - Text: Verification link message.
            - Helper: Return to app and log in message.
            - Spam note: Check spam folder.
            - NO form, NO inputs, NO buttons.
- **LoginPage component**:
    - Update login `handleSubmit`:
        - Ensure it blocks unverified users with a clear error message.
        - Ensure it ONLY redirects if `email_confirmed_at` is present.

### Route Protection

#### [MODIFY] [middleware.ts](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/ReceiptVault/src/middleware.ts)
- Reinforce strict blocking of unverified users from `/dashboard` and other protected routes.
- Ensure they are always redirected to `/login`.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. **Signup**: Verify modal switches to success state, NO redirect, NO login.
2. **Refresh**: Verify user remains logged out after refresh.
3. **Protected Access**: Attempt to visit `/dashboard` while unverified; verify redirect to `/login`.
4. **Login Attempt**: Attempt to login with an unverified account; verify error message and NO redirect.
5. **Full Flow**: Verify dashboard access ONLY after email verification + manual login.

